{"change_summary":"Confirmed the branch already contains the approved shrimp molt/reproduction fixes, so this apply-fixes pass was validation-only and required no additional source edits. I rechecked the relevant shrimp runtime and preset changes, then reran the focused reproduction and molt/mineral regressions plus the full `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios` suites; all passed on the current branch.","outstanding_risks":[],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current shrimp runtime and preset changes implicated by the approved review findings to confirm the branch already carried the requested fixes before editing anything.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reran the focused shrimp regression suites covering reproduction-factor behavior and mineral-gated molting to verify the reviewed paths still pass without further changes.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the full `tank_core` suite plus downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` tests to confirm broader stability and recorded this stage as validation-only because no new edits were needed.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short`","`git diff -- crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs`","`git diff -- crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs`","`git diff -- crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test reproduction_factors -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_data`","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios`"]}